 "text": "This is for the people who always end up on the couch because somebody will not stop snoring. You've tried nudging them, earplugs, even mouth tape. This is Mute, a tiny clear dilator that gently opens your nose. In their trial, seventy-five percent of users said they snored less. The starter pack has all three sizes, and each one lasts up to ten nights. Honestly, the worst part is losing your excuse to kick them at two AM. Holiday trips mean shared rooms, so grab one for you and one for your dad. It's in the orange cart.",
